WEBVTT

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:09.474
Disgaea

00:00:10.308 --> 00:00:15.803
It's like I'm tied up tight
by the sighs of love.

00:00:15.914 --> 00:00:20.851
I can't break free
no matter what spell I try.

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:28.559
Tranquil eyes that conceal
sorrow behind them...

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.791
...throw my heart into turmoil
more than they ought to.

00:00:36.034 --> 00:00:42.337
You mean more to me
than I do,

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:48.606
...even though we both refuse
to admit to our feelings.

00:00:48.713 --> 00:00:54.743
You're the one for me.
I don't care if you're a demon.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:01.452
Oh, this is a miracle that
I've stumbled upon.

00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:07.964
Even these wounds that never fade,
even this profound karma.

00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:11.297
Oh, I'll give you
my love.

00:01:11.503 --> 00:01:13.801
Time and again,
no matter where you are.

00:01:19.744 --> 00:01:22.440
I'll give you my love.

00:01:33.325 --> 00:01:37.091
If I don't do something,
they'll ruin all my plans...

00:01:48.139 --> 00:01:54.100
A Night Lit Up
By a Red Moon

00:02:12.097 --> 00:02:13.860
A red moon...

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.492
Oh, that. It's only natural,
this is Lunar Snowfield.

00:02:23.241 --> 00:02:27.200
Wait a minute. We should have warped
straight to Celestia. Why are we here?

00:02:30.015 --> 00:02:32.317
Red moon, red moon...
Do you hear something?

00:02:32.317 --> 00:02:36.185
Red moon, red moon...

00:02:36.521 --> 00:02:48.099
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:02:48.099 --> 00:02:53.138
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.
Look at all those Prinnies... Where do you
suppose such a huge crowd of them is going?

00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:56.107
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:02:58.209 --> 00:03:04.375
Red moon, red moon...

00:03:04.716 --> 00:03:07.886
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.
Good, just the flunkies I wanted to see.
I can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:03:07.886 --> 00:03:08.320
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:11.990
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.
I want to eat before I go to Celestia.
Prinnies! See to it!

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:12.123
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:03:12.123 --> 00:03:17.128
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.
Um... How can I put this?
Highness, this might not be the best time.

00:03:17.128 --> 00:03:21.366
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:03:21.366 --> 00:03:22.867
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.
Hey! You there!

00:03:22.867 --> 00:03:23.268
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:03:23.268 --> 00:03:24.135
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.
What's the big idea?!
All right, he's fired!

00:03:24.135 --> 00:03:24.803
What's the big idea?!
All right, he's fired!

00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:25.770
Who will be born again
this night?
What's the big idea?!
All right, he's fired!

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:25.971
Who will be born again
this night?

00:03:25.971 --> 00:03:27.939
Who will be born again
this night?
Next! Get over here,
Prinny!

00:03:27.939 --> 00:03:32.177
Who will be born again
this night?

00:03:32.177 --> 00:03:37.082
Who will be born again
this night?
Wait! Wait, curse you! Where do you think
you're going, defying my orders like that?!

00:03:37.082 --> 00:03:37.816
Who will be born again
this night?

00:03:37.816 --> 00:03:39.010
Who will be born again
this night?
You mustn't interfere.

00:03:41.319 --> 00:03:42.217
Stand aside!

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:46.780
Please, let them go.
They have atoned for their sins.

00:03:47.258 --> 00:03:49.453
What are you talking about,
you stupid Prinny?

00:03:49.561 --> 00:03:56.023
All that we can do is pray that their
next life will be a happy one.

00:03:59.437 --> 00:04:01.234
Who do you think
you are?!

00:04:01.439 --> 00:04:05.000
You forget that you're my vassal!
Never tell me what to do again!

00:04:06.077 --> 00:04:07.510
Highness!

00:04:10.982 --> 00:04:12.210
Excuse me...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.112
Yes?

00:04:13.218 --> 00:04:18.087
Um, you seem different from
the other Prinnies.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.584
Wha...? Uh, I have no idea what
you might be talking about.

00:04:23.962 --> 00:04:27.864
Well, there's the way you were praying just now,
not to mention the way that you talk...

00:04:27.966 --> 00:04:29.194
Could you be...

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:34.829
I-I have no idea what you mean. Dood.
I'm just like the others, dood!

00:04:45.517 --> 00:04:49.146
I understand. You must have your
reasons for keeping quiet.

00:04:49.621 --> 00:04:54.649
Let's say that I was thinking out loud.
Thank you very much.

00:04:56.728 --> 00:04:57.888
Flonne...

00:04:58.329 --> 00:05:02.129
The Prince seems to have changed a little
in the time since you arrived here.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:05.628
Really? Do you really
think so?

00:05:06.104 --> 00:05:07.128
Yes, I do.

00:05:07.539 --> 00:05:12.169
Oh, thank goodness! Hearing you
say that makes me so happy, Prinny!

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:16.403
I couldn't be sure, because people have
always told me that I make assumptions,

00:05:16.514 --> 00:05:19.449
or that I only see things
the way that I want to see them.

00:05:19.784 --> 00:05:22.617
But if you see a change
in him, too,

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:26.781
then maybe love really has started
to blossom in Laharl's heart!

00:05:27.192 --> 00:05:29.183
Let's overlook his little
tantrum just now...

00:05:30.061 --> 00:05:34.395
This makes me so happy!
Love really is amazing, isn't it?

00:05:34.966 --> 00:05:37.901
Yes, it truly is... Dood!

00:05:43.842 --> 00:05:46.140
Who does that impudent Prinny
think it is?

00:05:46.244 --> 00:05:47.768
Highness!

00:05:48.813 --> 00:05:54.183
Now, now, they'll all come back in a few days,
so don't get bent out of shape, okay?

00:05:54.319 --> 00:05:57.618
A few days? Where have all
the Prinnies gone, then?

00:05:57.722 --> 00:06:02.091
They made a break for it, that's all.
It's 'cause you treat them so badly.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.488
I'm kidding!

00:06:03.595 --> 00:06:07.190
I've had about enough of your lip, Etna!
You'd better "make a break for it," too!

00:06:16.407 --> 00:06:17.601
Laharl!

00:06:18.676 --> 00:06:21.201
Now YOU'RE here to give me some backtalk?
What do you want?

00:06:21.346 --> 00:06:24.144
You can be very inconsiderate
sometimes, Laharl!

00:06:24.749 --> 00:06:30.483
People's feelings are very delicate.
The tiniest little things can hurt them.

00:06:30.855 --> 00:06:35.087
You should treat everyone with
more kindness, and with more love!

00:06:35.226 --> 00:06:38.218
Never say the word "love"
in front of me!

00:06:38.596 --> 00:06:42.794
Don't lecture me like you know what you're
talking about! I'm never speaking to you again!

00:06:48.439 --> 00:06:51.101
Looks like you made him
even angrier.

00:06:51.509 --> 00:06:55.605
I don't understand... Why do you
suppose Laharl is so worked up?

00:06:56.848 --> 00:07:02.184
I spoke my mind to him because I thought that
love towards others had taken root in him.

00:07:02.287 --> 00:07:04.312
Why did he
get so mad?

00:07:04.422 --> 00:07:06.720
All us demons
are like that.

00:07:06.824 --> 00:07:10.521
Look, Flonne, I think you've got some
strange expectations about us.

00:07:10.795 --> 00:07:14.060
Maybe you're being a little unrealistic
to hope to find love in a demon.

00:07:14.165 --> 00:07:15.496
But just now, that...

00:07:16.501 --> 00:07:20.870
This makes me so happy!
Love really is amazing, isn't it?

00:07:21.606 --> 00:07:24.370
Yes, it truly is... Dood!

00:07:24.809 --> 00:07:25.741
"Just now"?

00:07:26.344 --> 00:07:29.336
N-Nothing happened
at all, dood!

00:07:29.581 --> 00:07:30.309
"Dood"?

00:07:31.015 --> 00:07:32.175
Now I'm saying it!

00:07:32.417 --> 00:07:35.113
Um, uh...
That is, I...

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:38.189
Well, the Prince might
be a special case.

00:07:38.456 --> 00:07:39.445
Special case?

00:07:39.557 --> 00:07:44.927
Yeah. The Prince's mother, in other words,
the woman who used to be our Queen,

00:07:45.063 --> 00:07:46.894
was a bit of an
oddball herself.

00:07:47.131 --> 00:07:50.965
At the drop of a hat, she'd start rambling
on and on about stuff like love and kindness.

00:07:51.069 --> 00:07:54.038
Huh? But there's nothing
strange about that.

00:07:54.372 --> 00:07:56.067
On the contrary, I'd say
it's completely normal.

00:07:56.174 --> 00:07:58.608
I didn't have anything
against the Queen,

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.611
but I guess it's to be expected,
her being human and all.

00:08:01.713 --> 00:08:05.012
Human? You mean Laharl's mother
was a human?

00:08:05.116 --> 00:08:08.108
Yeah. She'd been kidnapped
by some demon or other,

00:08:08.219 --> 00:08:11.154
and along came Overlord Krichevskoy
to rescue her from his clutches.

00:08:16.394 --> 00:08:19.227
It was love at first sight
for the Overlord.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:23.664
The happy couple got married,
and the result is our feisty Prince.

00:08:27.105 --> 00:08:30.131
You're kidding!
That's what happened?!

00:08:30.241 --> 00:08:33.836
Her Majesty would always say,
"Demons feel love, too."

00:08:33.945 --> 00:08:35.970
It was like her catchphrase
or something.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:39.481
She said that she wanted the Prince
to grow up to be a kindhearted demon,

00:08:39.584 --> 00:08:42.712
so whenever he did something bad
or hurt someone, she'd go,

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.687
"Demons feel love,
too, Laharl."

00:08:46.024 --> 00:08:49.289
"Everyone has a heart, and that
heart is very delicate."

00:08:49.427 --> 00:08:51.759
"It can be hurt by the slightest
little thing."

00:08:51.896 --> 00:08:55.696
"That's why I want you to treat
everyone with kindness and love."

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:56.828
It was like that.

00:08:56.934 --> 00:08:59.368
What a wonderful way
to teach him about love!

00:08:59.937 --> 00:09:03.839
But you know, it kinda reminds me
of what I said to him...

00:09:04.809 --> 00:09:07.573
You know, maybe you remind him
of the Queen, Flonne.

00:09:08.212 --> 00:09:13.445
But if Laharl was raised by such a wonderful
mother, why did he turn out the way he did?

00:09:15.586 --> 00:09:16.985
His mother died.

00:09:18.356 --> 00:09:21.484
A long time ago, the Prince
came down with a disease...

00:09:21.626 --> 00:09:24.390
...that not even the Overlord's
power could cure.

00:09:24.862 --> 00:09:28.821
There was only one thing
that could save the Prince's life.

00:09:29.167 --> 00:09:30.395
Which was?

00:09:30.635 --> 00:09:33.035
The life of someone
who loved him.

00:09:33.137 --> 00:09:34.263
Are you saying
that she...

00:09:34.372 --> 00:09:40.368
The Overlord begged her not to, but she
gave up her own life to save the Prince's.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:50.710
I think that's when it started. That's when
he started to hate love and kindness.

00:09:50.955 --> 00:09:54.686
Oh, no... So are you saying that
as long as that hatred remains,

00:09:54.826 --> 00:10:00.594
Laharl will have to go through life
with his heart closed to love?

00:10:01.032 --> 00:10:05.093
But if that happens...
It's too sad to think about!

00:10:05.236 --> 00:10:06.294
You might be right.

00:10:06.437 --> 00:10:10.635
But I don't think that the Prince
intentionally hates those feelings.

00:10:10.975 --> 00:10:14.934
I guess hatred doesn't simply go away
just because you want it to.

00:10:15.046 --> 00:10:18.174
That's just too sad...

00:11:13.938 --> 00:11:15.462
What are those lights?

00:11:19.644 --> 00:11:21.509
Those are their souls.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.484
Etna, what are those?

00:11:27.919 --> 00:11:30.080
Surely you've heard
the stories.

00:11:31.522 --> 00:11:36.482
Within every Prinny is a soul
of a human who has sinned.

00:11:36.994 --> 00:11:41.988
To atone for those sins, the Prinnies labor
in either Celestia or the Netherworld.

00:11:42.366 --> 00:11:47.497
Those lights are the souls of those
who have atoned for their sins.

00:11:47.939 --> 00:11:50.965
The red moon cleanses away
the stain of their sins...

00:11:51.209 --> 00:11:54.007
...and lets them be born
into their next life.

00:11:54.111 --> 00:11:56.807
There's something heart wrenching
about this sight, isn't there?

00:11:56.914 --> 00:11:59.144
Oh, what a
heart wrenching sight!

00:12:03.287 --> 00:12:06.586
Damn it, I never said you stinking
Prinnies could be reborn!

00:12:06.924 --> 00:12:09.085
I'm gonna yank your sorry hides
back here by force if I have to!

00:12:09.227 --> 00:12:11.058
You mustn't interfere!

00:12:15.633 --> 00:12:16.793
Stand aside,
Mid-Boss!

00:12:26.244 --> 00:12:27.643
Who do you people
think you are?

00:12:27.745 --> 00:12:31.613
We take souls of Prinnies
to red moon...

00:12:31.849 --> 00:12:33.578
If you interfere,
we eliminate you...

00:12:33.684 --> 00:12:38.678
"Eliminate" me, huh? Let's see you try!
You're not getting those Prinnies!

00:12:39.023 --> 00:12:43.221
They're my vassals!
From now until the end of time!

00:12:58.075 --> 00:13:00.043
Disgaea

00:13:01.312 --> 00:13:07.046
Disgaea

00:13:11.222 --> 00:13:13.747
I'm not letting the Prinnies go!
Never!

00:13:21.465 --> 00:13:23.990
Get back here, Prinnies!
I command it!

00:13:24.335 --> 00:13:26.394
You're my vassals,
remember?!

00:13:26.804 --> 00:13:28.635
Stop this!

00:13:40.651 --> 00:13:41.583
Laharl!

00:13:41.852 --> 00:13:44.320
What do you think
you're doing, Highness?

00:13:48.793 --> 00:13:53.230
My vassals are my personal property!
I won't let you people walk off with them!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.331
You're the Overlord now,
Highness!

00:13:58.436 --> 00:14:01.997
Why's the King of the Netherworld
getting so worked over little stuff like this...

00:14:02.106 --> 00:14:05.041
...when he's supposed to be on
his way to take over Celestia?!

00:14:05.543 --> 00:14:08.307
Shut up! I'm not handing
over these Prinnies!

00:14:09.981 --> 00:14:13.041
Why you interfere
with our work?

00:14:13.284 --> 00:14:14.342
Your work?

00:14:15.453 --> 00:14:19.082
They're right! You mustn't interfere
with what they're doing!

00:14:20.992 --> 00:14:26.589
They are emissaries who are here to escort
the Prinnies' souls safely to the red moon!

00:14:27.064 --> 00:14:30.329
What about it?
What difference should that make?!

00:14:34.005 --> 00:14:38.533
Highness! If you truly value
your vassals,

00:14:40.111 --> 00:14:42.671
if you have any affection
for them at all,

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:46.807
then surely you must be able to give
their rebirth your blessing.

00:14:47.451 --> 00:14:53.822
The sinful human soul within each Prinny is as
delicate and easily injured as anyone else's.

00:14:54.325 --> 00:15:00.560
If you are the true Overlord, I beg you, treat
them with kindness, compassion, and love.

00:15:01.098 --> 00:15:04.735
To unite the Netherworld with love,
kindness, and compassion!

00:15:04.735 --> 00:15:06.862
That is the mark of
a true Overlord!

00:15:07.438 --> 00:15:08.598
What?!

00:15:11.375 --> 00:15:14.344
Demons feel love, too,
Laharl.

00:15:14.612 --> 00:15:17.342
Demons feel love, too,
Highness.

00:15:17.848 --> 00:15:22.581
Please, let them go.
They have atoned for their sins.

00:15:22.953 --> 00:15:29.552
All that we can do is pray that their
next life will be a happy one.

00:15:30.728 --> 00:15:33.925
Demons feel love, too,
Laharl.

00:15:40.905 --> 00:15:43.032
This is what's best
for the Prinnies?

00:15:43.274 --> 00:15:44.741
- It is.
- It is.

00:15:51.849 --> 00:15:55.012
Fine, whatever.
Do what you want.

00:16:14.472 --> 00:16:16.440
I'm glad that we got
through to him.

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:20.041
With my mind now at ease, I can
leave for the red moon, too.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.474
Wait!

00:16:24.749 --> 00:16:28.207
What was... What sin
did you commit?

00:16:31.856 --> 00:16:35.656
My sin was...
I took my own life.

00:16:36.894 --> 00:16:40.295
To take your own life
is a grave sin.

00:16:40.564 --> 00:16:43.556
But why would someone as kind and
caring as you do such a thing?

00:16:45.436 --> 00:16:48.064
I did it to save the life
of my son.

00:16:52.576 --> 00:16:57.513
My death caused my son
to lock away his precious feelings.

00:16:58.015 --> 00:17:02.918
But now, little by little,
he's beginning to change.

00:17:03.254 --> 00:17:06.951
He owes that to the wonderful
people that surround him.

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.824
My work here as his mother
is complete.

00:17:13.364 --> 00:17:16.856
The rest is up to my son
to see his own way through.

00:17:24.675 --> 00:17:25.642
Wait!

00:17:28.512 --> 00:17:32.346
Please, wait! If you love
your son so much,

00:17:32.449 --> 00:17:34.007
why are you leaving without
saying anything to him?!

00:17:37.154 --> 00:17:39.349
You mean to say that this
is cruel, aren't you?

00:17:40.591 --> 00:17:42.786
Of course I want to tell him
that I'm his mother!

00:17:42.927 --> 00:17:45.521
Of course I want to hold him
in my arms!

00:17:47.164 --> 00:17:50.600
But if we would have to
eventually part again,

00:17:50.734 --> 00:17:55.899
it would also be an act of love to watch over
him in silence and leave without saying a word.

00:17:58.742 --> 00:18:02.007
Enduring that sadness
once is enough.

00:18:02.112 --> 00:18:04.580
That is another way
of showing your love.

00:18:04.915 --> 00:18:06.109
I'm sorry...

00:18:06.217 --> 00:18:12.986
I'm so sorry! I forced my own notion of love on
you without stopping to consider your feelings!

00:18:13.224 --> 00:18:14.486
I'm sorry!

00:18:14.925 --> 00:18:20.192
The Prince truly has met a
wonderful person, hasn't he?

00:18:24.034 --> 00:18:26.696
Highness, be well.

00:18:27.371 --> 00:18:31.068
Flonne, Etna, take good care
of the Prince.

00:18:31.175 --> 00:18:31.869
We will!

00:18:31.976 --> 00:18:33.307
Will do!

00:18:41.352 --> 00:18:42.819
Well, it's time
to go.

00:18:44.054 --> 00:18:45.646
Goodbye.

00:18:47.625 --> 00:18:53.825
Red moon, red moon...

00:18:54.331 --> 00:19:13.582
The red moon will cleanse the souls
of those who have sinned.

00:19:18.889 --> 00:19:23.792
The red moon wobbled and trembled
as it was reflected in Laharl's eyes.

00:19:24.228 --> 00:19:27.425
Just like his own heart
was wavering inside him.

00:19:27.765 --> 00:19:32.600
He had always claimed that he felt no love
or kindness because he was a demon.

00:19:32.937 --> 00:19:36.896
But I think that the real reason that
he denied the love in his heart...

00:19:37.007 --> 00:19:39.669
...was because he loved
his mother so much.

00:19:40.611 --> 00:19:46.948
His mother, who was so full of love
and kindness, died in his place.

00:19:48.052 --> 00:19:52.113
Rejecting love and kindness
was probably the only way...

00:19:52.256 --> 00:19:55.953
...that he could come to terms
with his mother's death.

00:19:56.527 --> 00:20:00.486
I think it must have been hard for him.
It must have been painful for him.

00:20:00.631 --> 00:20:03.759
And I think that it must have
been very sad for him.

00:20:04.168 --> 00:20:10.698
But maybe the red moon in his eyes
will wash away his painful past.

00:20:37.334 --> 00:20:44.467
That red moon was etched deep in my heart,
along with a new type of love.

00:20:45.342 --> 00:20:50.075
I'll never forget their sad love
for as long as I live.

00:21:09.733 --> 00:21:11.200
Everyone?

00:21:12.903 --> 00:21:14.234
What's the matter?

00:21:14.338 --> 00:21:18.206
Laharl, I mean Highness,
I mean Overlord Laharl!

00:21:18.409 --> 00:21:23.073
You are now the mighty Overlord!
The world is your oyster!

00:21:23.313 --> 00:21:26.476
There is nothing that
the Overlord can't do!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:30.242
Gee, you sound like you were once
Overlord yourself, Mid-Boss.

00:21:31.722 --> 00:21:35.089
Perish the thought! I'm just a humble Mid-Boss
who happened to be passing through!

00:21:35.225 --> 00:21:38.524
Those two are a lot alike,
aren't they?

00:21:39.029 --> 00:21:40.189
How are they alike?

00:21:40.297 --> 00:21:43.391
Um... They both kinda
live in a bubble.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:45.934
Uh, I wouldn't be pointing
any fingers there, Flonne.

00:21:47.104 --> 00:21:49.971
Well, no matter.
I'M Overlord now.

00:21:52.609 --> 00:21:56.170
I am Overlord!
Take me to Celestia!

00:22:41.058 --> 00:22:48.487
If people ever notice the cycle of time
on this world where blue skies come and go,

00:22:48.932 --> 00:22:56.566
something's bound to happen when people
with different outlooks get together.

00:22:56.874 --> 00:23:04.713
Will we be buried by our desires?
Will love come and save the day?

00:23:04.815 --> 00:23:11.778
Either way, it doesn't matter to me.
I'm gonna do as I please.

00:23:12.456 --> 00:23:20.227
Light and shadow, egoists for whom
everything in the world has meaning,

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:28.032
every little fragment lives his life
with the balance on their shoulders.

00:23:28.138 --> 00:23:35.442
Doing whatever we want,
having it exactly the way we want it.

00:23:36.146 --> 00:23:39.877
Right now,
under the same sky,

00:23:39.983 --> 00:23:43.976
light and shadow
repeat again and again.

00:23:44.888 --> 00:23:49.188
Chain react...

00:23:56.934 --> 00:24:01.428
The Disgaea that you know and love
will finally be coming to an end next week!

00:24:01.538 --> 00:24:05.030
What?! It's over already?!
Aw, I wanted to see some more...

00:24:05.142 --> 00:24:07.440
No matter what you're doing,
you gotta know when to fold 'em!

00:24:07.544 --> 00:24:12.140
Once Disgaea ends, tune in for the
new show, "Flonne's Counterattack"!

00:24:12.249 --> 00:24:14.809
Actually, that sounds kinda interesting.
Maybe I'll catch an episode.

00:24:14.918 --> 00:24:19.252
Next time on Disgaea,
"Love... After the Fighting's Over."

00:24:20.090 --> 00:24:22.893
Next Time:
Love... After the Fighting's Over
I can't believe it,
you read off the final title!

00:24:22.893 --> 00:24:24.986
Next Time:
Love... After the Fighting's Over
